{"The totpStep1 and loginTotpStep1 keys in Lithuanian (_lt.properties) files contain Italian text instead of Lithuanian, which will display Italian text to Lithuanian-speaking users on the TOTP setup page": 0.9934518337249756, "The totpStep1 key in the Simplified Chinese (zh_CN) file uses Traditional Chinese characters (\u624b\u6a5f, \u61c9\u7528\u7a0b\u5f0f) instead of Simplified Chinese (\u624b\u673a, \u5e94\u7528\u7a0b\u5e8f), displaying incorrect character variants to Mainland China users": 0.9872679114341736}